<title>POLAND: Boryszew corrects group results for 1996.</title>
<headline>Boryszew corrects group results for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boryszew group results for the the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit		    17.73   vs   14.33</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			15.28   vs   11.85</p>
<p>    group net profit			     8.89   vs    7.27</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Boryszew SA. Company corrected its operating, pre-tax and net profit from 33.14, 30.69 and 24.31 million zlotys respectively.</p>
<p>    group net sales			    111.29   vs  119.73</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			77.75   vs   93.17</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		   0.20   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    group income tax			     6.40   vs    4.57</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		   1.46   vs    2.90</p>
<p>    group financial costs			3.74   vs    5.42</p>
<p>    group investment			    21.78   vs    6.92</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
